{
  "info": {
    "name": "Galgoth Studio API",
    "description": "Colección Postman de Galgoth Studio -- ver docs/API.md.",
    "schema": "https://schema.getpostman.com/json/collection/v2.1.0/collection.json"
  },
  "variable": [
    { "key": "baseUrl", "value": "http://localhost:8080" },
    { "key": "projectId", "value": "" },
    { "key": "mobId", "value": "" }
  ],
  "item": [
    {
      "name": "Proyectos (ticket 021)",
      "item": [
        {
          "name": "Crear proyecto",
          "request": {
            "method": "POST",
            "header": [{ "key": "Content-Type", "value": "application/json" }],
            "body": { "mode": "raw", "raw": "{\n  \"name\": \"Nuevo proyecto\"\n}" },
            "url": { "raw": "{{baseUrl}}/api/projects", "host": ["{{baseUrl}}"], "path": ["api", "projects"] },
            "description": "201 con el ProjectDetail si el nombre es válido; 400 (INVALID_PROJECT_NAME) si está vacío -- ningún proyecto se crea."
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "Listar proyectos (dashboard)",
          "request": {
            "method": "GET",
            "header": [],
            "url": { "raw": "{{baseUrl}}/api/projects", "host": ["{{baseUrl}}"], "path": ["api", "projects"] },
            "description": "ProjectSummary[] -- hasta 3 mobThumbnails por proyecto, sin los soft-deleted, ordenados por updatedAt desc."
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "Obtener detalle de un proyecto",
          "request": {
            "method": "GET",
            "header": [],
            "url": {
              "raw": "{{baseUrl}}/api/projects/{{projectId}}",
              "host": ["{{baseUrl}}"],
              "path": ["api", "projects", "{{projectId}}"]
            },
            "description": "404 (PROJECT_NOT_FOUND) si no existe o está soft-deleted."
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "Renombrar proyecto",
          "request": {
            "method": "PATCH",
            "header": [{ "key": "Content-Type", "value": "application/json" }],
            "body": { "mode": "raw", "raw": "{\n  \"name\": \"Nombre nuevo\"\n}" },
            "url": {
              "raw": "{{baseUrl}}/api/projects/{{projectId}}",
              "host": ["{{baseUrl}}"],
              "path": ["api", "projects", "{{projectId}}"]
            }
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "Eliminar proyecto (soft-delete)",
          "request": {
            "method": "DELETE",
            "header": [],
            "url": {
              "raw": "{{baseUrl}}/api/projects/{{projectId}}",
              "host": ["{{baseUrl}}"],
              "path": ["api", "projects", "{{projectId}}"]
            },
            "description": "204. Marca projects.deleted_at -- el proyecto deja de aparecer en cualquier consulta."
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "Duplicar proyecto (copia profunda)",
          "request": {
            "method": "POST",
            "header": [],
            "url": {
              "raw": "{{baseUrl}}/api/projects/{{projectId}}/duplicate",
              "host": ["{{baseUrl}}"],
              "path": ["api", "projects", "{{projectId}}", "duplicate"]
            },
            "description": "201 con el ProjectDetail de la copia -- copia el proyecto y TODOS sus mobs con su historial completo de mob_revisions y su mob_drafts actual."
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "Mobs (ticket 022)",
      "item": [
        {
          "name": "Agregar mob",
          "request": {
            "method": "POST",
            "header": [{ "key": "Content-Type", "value": "application/json" }],
            "body": { "mode": "raw", "raw": "{\n  \"name\": \"Carcomido\",\n  \"baseType\": \"humanoid\"\n}" },
            "url": {
              "raw": "{{baseUrl}}/api/projects/{{projectId}}/mobs",
              "host": ["{{baseUrl}}"],
              "path": ["api", "projects", "{{projectId}}", "mobs"]
            },
            "description": "201 con el MobSummary -- status siempre 'draft', current_revision_number=0, sin fila en mob_drafts. baseType: humanoid|arachnid|quadruped|flying|custom. 400 (INVALID_MOB_REQUEST) si el nombre está vacío o baseType es inválido."
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "Listar mobs de un proyecto (grid de detalle)",
          "request": {
            "method": "GET",
            "header": [],
            "url": {
              "raw": "{{baseUrl}}/api/projects/{{projectId}}/mobs",
              "host": ["{{baseUrl}}"],
              "path": ["api", "projects", "{{projectId}}", "mobs"]
            },
            "description": "MobSummary[] -- el filtro por nombre del buscador es client-side, sin parámetro de búsqueda aquí."
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "Draft / Guardar (ticket 020)",
      "item": [
        {
          "name": "Obtener el draft actual de un mob",
          "request": {
            "method": "GET",
            "header": [],
            "url": {
              "raw": "{{baseUrl}}/api/mobs/{{mobId}}/draft",
              "host": ["{{baseUrl}}"],
              "path": ["api", "mobs", "{{mobId}}", "draft"]
            },
            "description": "200 con { mobId, draftVersion, model, updatedAt } si existe, 404 explícito (DRAFT_NOT_FOUND) si el mob todavía no tiene ningún draft persistido, 404 (MOB_NOT_FOUND) si el mob no existe."
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "Autosave del draft",
          "request": {
            "method": "PATCH",
            "header": [{ "key": "Content-Type", "value": "application/json" }],
            "body": {
              "mode": "raw",
              "raw": "{\n  \"model\": { }\n}"
            },
            "url": {
              "raw": "{{baseUrl}}/api/mobs/{{mobId}}/draft",
              "host": ["{{baseUrl}}"],
              "path": ["api", "mobs", "{{mobId}}", "draft"]
            },
            "description": "Persiste mob_drafts SOLO si el contenido cambió materialmente respecto al último persistido -- responde { changed, draftVersion, updatedAt }. `changed:false` significa que no se escribió nada (ni siquiera updated_at). Nunca crea una mob_revision. 404 (MOB_NOT_FOUND) si el mob no existe."
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "Guardar (crea una revisión)",
          "request": {
            "method": "POST",
            "header": [{ "key": "Content-Type", "value": "application/json" }],
            "body": {
              "mode": "raw",
              "raw": "{\n  \"model\": { }\n}"
            },
            "url": {
              "raw": "{{baseUrl}}/api/mobs/{{mobId}}/revisions",
              "host": ["{{baseUrl}}"],
              "path": ["api", "mobs", "{{mobId}}", "revisions"]
            },
            "description": "Valida el draft actual contra el JSON Schema y crea una fila inmutable en mob_revisions -- 201 si created:true (nueva revisión), 200 si created:false (sin cambios desde la última revisión, no se duplica), 400 (INVALID_DRAFT, con `details`) si falla la validación, 404 (MOB_NOT_FOUND) si el mob no existe."
          }
        }
      ]
    }
  ]
}
